<!--
    Explore tab. Converted from the Figma nav icon (node 118:515): a SOLID
    filled disc with the compass needle and centre dot knocked out of it.

    The previous version was an outlined ring with a needle inside. Against
    four solid-filled neighbours it read as visibly lighter and less
    substantial, which is what made it stand out as inconsistent in the bar.

    The knockout depends on subpath winding direction under the default
    non-zero fill rule, which Android shares with SVG — so the path data is
    copied verbatim rather than reconstructed, and fillType is deliberately
    left at its default. Changing either would fill the needle in solid.

    Group scale/translate: see ic_discover for why the 0..20 export is fitted
    into a 24-unit viewport spanning 3..21.

    fillColor is a placeholder: the nav ColorStateList tints it per state.
-->
